[{"title":"感秋 其六","author":"何绛","text":"朝汉台成千载馀，苍苍松柏绕阶除。\n蛮夷长老知天命，陆贾南来一纸书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41663,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感秋 其七","author":"何绛","text":"孙恪当年事出关，美人北去泪潸潸。\n凭君莫过舒州寺，恐献山僧碧玉环。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41664,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感秋 其八","author":"何绛","text":"十千美酒泛蒲桃，一饮那知白日高。\n中使夜来开凤诏，依然沉醉鹔鹴袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41665,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感秋 其九","author":"何绛","text":"珠江江上水连天，绛叶纷飞满客船。\n欲送王孙开祖帐，琵琶马上觉凄然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41666,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠杨敏叔","author":"何绛","text":"白发千条倚道旁，频将肝胆与人尝。\n田园散尽寻常事，一剑当门夜夜光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41667,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"任肇楚下第归冈州诗以寄之时重阳后一日 其一","author":"何绛","text":"众芳摇落西风里，霜叶如花斗艳时。\n遥忆故交明月夜，等闲吹笛拟桓伊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41668,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"任肇楚下第归冈州诗以寄之时重阳后一日 其二","author":"何绛","text":"郑老琵琶去不回，赖君指拨六幺来。\n世人自是知音少，君自弹君大小雷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41669,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"任肇楚下第归冈州诗以寄之时重阳后一日 其三","author":"何绛","text":"黄菊花开满砌间，未妨杯酒醉离颜。\n閒心羡尔溪山好，又得三年放白鹇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41670,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿崔母李太君 其一","author":"何绛","text":"板舆佳日适閒园，半是青童半子孙。\n疏竹池边开桂酒，罗浮仙液本来温。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41671,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿崔母李太君 其二","author":"何绛","text":"灵飞小妹李家姝，仙籍通来本不殊。\n闻穜扶桑高万丈，上栖丹凤一双雏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41672,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿崔母李太君 其三","author":"何绛","text":"阿母层楼傍水汀，由来仙媛乐沧溟。\n试言震泽包山妇，或住湘江或洞庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41673,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖曲 其一","author":"何绛","text":"龙游山下桃花庄，鸡犬桑麻自一方。\n地似避秦人稍异，村中忙煞为官粮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41674,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖曲 其二","author":"何绛","text":"小小湖船十尺长，大黄塘过小黄塘。\n渔翁日午停双桨，贪卧南风系绿杨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41675,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖曲 其三","author":"何绛","text":"千株杨柳数家村，茅屋檐前鹊噪喧。\n竟日了无他客至，荷花空自绕柴门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41676,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖曲 其四","author":"何绛","text":"雨后乘舟坐晚凉，美人西望路茫茫。\n人间是处皆尘土，清静惟留水一方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41677,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖曲 其五","author":"何绛","text":"试上山头奠桂浆，朝云艳骨有馀香。\n宋朝陵墓皆零落，嫁得文人胜帝王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41678,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖后曲 其一","author":"何绛","text":"木鹅城下是菱溪，溪水东流不贮泥。\n好趁明月齐打桨，苏公堤过又甘堤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41679,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖后曲 其二","author":"何绛","text":"栖禅寺口月明时，欲系扁舟限柳丝。\n岂是薄情离别易，亏人折尽路头枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41680,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖后曲 其三","author":"何绛","text":"芰荷过尽出蒹葭，下郭村前月色斜。\n山近罗浮无恶虎，如何闾巷少人家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41681,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖后曲 其四","author":"何绛","text":"忘机亭接集鸥涯，秋月秋风事事佳。\n世上机心忘已尽，不知何事复伤怀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41682,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖后曲 其五","author":"何绛","text":"元戎小队朔方音，船上吹笳到夜深。\n遮莫游龙山下过，恐伤司马旧雄心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41683,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖后曲 其六","author":"何绛","text":"绿琴弹罢月空明，鸟语花香水复清。\n昨日刺船人不见，先生无乃善移情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41684,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖后曲 其七","author":"何绛","text":"孤山山上吊孤忠，难听高秋半夜风。\n叔父山河今已改，留都虽捷亦成空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41685,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖后曲 其八","author":"何绛","text":"布帆高挂夜风寒，漫把银筝向月弹。\n罗袜罗衫裁几样，隔堤楼是不相干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41686,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖后曲 其九","author":"何绛","text":"西湖明月昔时光，今日重游太息长。\n记得十年湖上别，玉簪除下赠新妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41687,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖后曲 其十","author":"何绛","text":"谁家年少泛湖船，永夜清歌对月圆。\n红日渐高犹未觉，玉杯狼藉尚缠绵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41688,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"家二兄入罗浮余之循州承陈独漉珠江送别后却寄 其一","author":"何绛","text":"雁翅逢君已隔年，一回相忆一回怜。\n冰姿点污何容易，白发上头不再玄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41689,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"家二兄入罗浮余之循州承陈独漉珠江送别后却寄 其二","author":"何绛","text":"三湘曾共客江浔，散发狂歌屈子心。\n自喜年来无个事，每于清夜一追寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41690,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"家二兄入罗浮余之循州承陈独漉珠江送别后却寄 其三","author":"何绛","text":"同君食罢武昌鱼，建业江头又寄居。\n君自文章满天下，等闲须著纪游书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41691,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"家二兄入罗浮余之循州承陈独漉珠江送别后却寄 其四","author":"何绛","text":"细雨春风习习生，罗浮山下正开耕。\n心能绝俗何妨隐，莫泥夷齐要弟兄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41692,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陶握山 其一","author":"何绛","text":"百峰山下石塘清，草屋萧萧亦称情。\n只爱素心邻曲过，新将五柳种佗城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41693,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陶握山 其二","author":"何绛","text":"流莺千啭柳丝长，日及芳菲满路傍。\n料得此时陶处士，行行且嗅野花香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41694,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陶握山 其三","author":"何绛","text":"白鹤峰头春月明，黄塘树里子规声。\n夜深独自开瑶瑟，山客谁知素女情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41695,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陶握山 其四","author":"何绛","text":"粤王旧国几翻新，满眼高车触路尘。\n余亦白头君渐老，山中桂树恐嗤人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41696,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄洪庾山","author":"何绛","text":"郊西篱落菜花初，五柳门前君旧居。\n章甫朱轮都弗羡，不知深夜著何书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41697,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄梁药亭 其一","author":"何绛","text":"挟瑟归来路八千，米囊花发杏花鲜。\n閒厅祇自弹归雁，世上何人识此弦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41698,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄梁药亭 其二","author":"何绛","text":"村居闻复住芙蓉，终日吟诗对岸松。\n欲访草堂诵新句，水云遥隔一重重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":41699,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dyn